        <p><img src="Pictures/WM Pics/2026WMLawrence.jpg" width="500" height="750"></p>
        <p>&nbsp;<b>
            <div class="page-centered-text">
              <font color="#000000" size="5" face="Trebuchet MS">Duck Creek Masonic Lodge July Stated Meeting will be on
                Monday, July 13, 2026 at 7:00pm.</font>
        </p>
        <p>
          <font color="#000000" size="4" face="Trebuchet MS">Installation of officers was held on Wednesday, July 1,
            2026 at 7:00pm. We had a great crowd of members and visitors -
        </p>
        <p>We also held the drawing for our Duck Creek Education Foundation fund raising raffle, with two luck
          winners getting a $300 Gift Card to Bass Pro. Thanks to everyone who participated in selling and
          purchasing raffle tickets.</p>
        <p>Duck Creek Masonic Lodge will be celebrating the July 4 holiday on Friday evening, July 3 with a cookout -
          we will then sit back in our lawn chairs and watch the City of Garland fireworks show from our parking
          lot. We hope to see you there! We will be grilling hamburgers and hot dogs. If anyone wants anything
          different, bring it and we will grill it!!</font>
        </p>
        </div>
