        <font color="#000000" size="5" face="Trebuchet MS">Blood Drives</font><br><br>
        <div class="page-centered-text" <p>Our July Blood Drive is on Saturday, July 11 at the <a
            href="https://premiergunshows.com/gun-show/mesquite-gun-show/" target="blank"> Mesquite Gun Show,</a>
          located at <a href="https://mapq.st/4ajHsDI" target="blank"> 1700 Rodeo Dr, Mesquite, TX 75149</a>
          </p>

          <p>Duck Creek Masonic Lodge is located at <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/53rf7KQKUWL5YLFg7"
              target="_blank">600 N. 5th Street in Garland, TX</a></p>

          <p>Stated Meetings are the second Monday of each Month at <span class="red-color">7:00pm</span></p>

          <p>The <a href="dcef/index_dcef.html" target="_blank">Duck Creek Education Foundation</a> is a 501c(3)
            foundation and is accepting donations for school supplies and scholarship awards. Scholarships were
            awarded in May of 2026, and we continue to collect for the School Supply Drive to support the
            financially distressed elementary school children within Garland Independent School District. Contact
            the Lodge at 469-249-2076 for additional information. Click on <a href="https://square.link/u/goj48rEP"
              target="blank">This Link</a> to donate to the Duck Creek Education Foundation using Square.<br><br>
          </p>
        </div>

